	(footprint "da3:Infineon_TDSON-8_FL"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "609c8219-9eb1-41e7-afab-e34e049f62ec")
		(at 21.7 65.1 90)
		(descr "Infineon PG-TDSON-8 FL (fused leads, SuperSO8), BSC016N06NS. KiCad TDSON-8-1 with pins 1-4 lengthened to Infineon's board pads: BSC016N06NS datasheet rev 2.6 (2024-06-11) Fig 2 'TDSON-8 Fused Leads: Boardpads' - drain 4.55 x 4.41, 1.00 gap, lead pads 1.10 long, 6.65 overall. KiCad's were 0.85 long with a 1.25 gap, short of the lead's inner end (L up to 0.72 from the body edge). Gate pad 4 is 0.90 long, not 1.10: a routed 5V via sits 0.5 mm off Q2's gate pad (the gate carries no current, 0.9 still covers the lead). Pins 1-3 are kept as separate pads (Infineon fuses them; they are one net and the VIN pour joins them)")
